pan class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>\"Vandalise\", \"Destroy\" &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; \"Deteriorate\", _________ &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Ameliorate</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Ameliorate</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Degenerate</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Degenerate</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Improve</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Improve</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Progress</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Progress</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Vandalise is the synonym for Destroy in the same way Deteriorate is the synonym for Degenerate.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>'Greedy' is related to 'Generous' in the same way as 'Vindictive' is related to:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>'Greedy' &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2340;&#2352;&#2361; 'Generous' &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2340;&#2352;&#2361; 'Vindictive' &#2360;&#2375; '_______' &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Merciful</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Merciful</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Revengeful</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Revengeful</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Inimical</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Inimical</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Apathetic</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Apathetic</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Greedy is the antonym of generous. Similarly, vindictive is the antonym of merciful. Vindictive means showing a strong desire for revenge while merciful means forgiving.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option in which the words share the same relationship as that shared by the given pair of words.</p><p>Wheel : Spoke</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2350;&#2381;&#2348;&#2344;&#2381;&#2343; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2366;&#2333;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2332;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350;&#2379;&#2306; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2360;&#2366;&#2333;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>&#2346;&#2361;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; : &#2340;&#2367;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354;&#2368;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Table : Chair</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2375;&#2332;&#2364; : &#2325;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2360;&#2368;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">House : Room</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2328;&#2352; : &#2325;&#2350;&#2352;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Star : Galaxy</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2340;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; : &#2310;&#2325;&#2366;&#2358;&#2327;&#2306;&#2327;&#2366;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Chapter : Book</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2351; : &#2346;&#2369;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2325;</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Spokes are parts of wheels, which make up the wheel. Similarly, rooms make up a house.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the related word from the given alternatives.</p><p>FLIES: BUSINESS::ANTS:?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>FLIES: BUSINESS::ANTS:?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Army</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Army</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Pack</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Pack</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Flock</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Flock</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Troop</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Troop</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Collective noun of Flies is business. Likewise, the collective noun for ants is army.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the related letters/words/numbers from the given alternatives.</p><p>VOLLEYBALL : FOUL : : EXAM : ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306;/&#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306;/&#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>VOLLEYBALL : FOUL : : EXAM : ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">SCORE</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">SCORE</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">FAIL</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">FAIL</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">MALPRACTICE</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">MALPRACTICE</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">PASS</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">PASS</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>A foul is considered as a violation of rules in volleyball. Similar is the case for malpractice in an exam. Both are considered to be unacceptable.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option which is related to the fourth term in the same way as the first term is related to the second term. </p><p><b>Liberty : Autonomy : : ? : Morality</b></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2330;&#2380;&#2341;&#2375; &#2346;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2366; &#2346;&#2342;, &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2346;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p><b>Liberty : Autonomy : : ? : Morality</b></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Iniquity</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Iniquity</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Wicked</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Wicked</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Ethos</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Ethos</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Pursue</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Pursue</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Liberty and autonomy are synonyms of each other. Similarly, ethos and morality are synonyms. </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option that is related to the third word in the same way as the second word is related to be first word.</p><p>Frolicsome : Cheerful :: Woebegone : ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342;, &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>Frolicsome : Cheerful :: Woebegone : ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Happy</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Happy</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Sad</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Sad</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Joy</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Joy</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Fear</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Fear</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>As synonym of cheerful is Frolicsome in the same way the synonym of Woebegone is Sad.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option that is related to the third word in the same way as the second word is related to the first word.</p><p>Brazil : Real :: Bulgaria : ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342;, &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>Brazil : Real :: Bulgaria : ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Franc</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Franc</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Lev</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Lev</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Dollar</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Dollar</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Riel</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Riel</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>The currency of Brazil is real similarly the currency of Bulgaria is Lev. </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Choose the pair of words having the same relation as in the given pair of words.</p><p>Vegetable : Chop : : Body: ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;|</p><p>Vegetable : Chop : : Body: ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">Cut</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Cut</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Amputate</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Amputate</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Peel</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Peel</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">Prune</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">Prune</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Cutting of vegetables is called chopping, cutting of a body organ is called amputation.</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}